'' RUN: 'kind as kind', a field named like its own ENUM type. The typed lookup stepped past a
'' variable, parameter or constant of the enum's name to reach the enum, but not past a FIELD:
'' the field resolved to itself, the record was never laid out, and every use of the type
'' declined (TKO0994; Rosetta Associative_array_Creation's 'datatype as datatype'; fbc-examples
'' repro ice22). Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/field-named-like-enum.bas -o tests/codegen/fieldnamedlikeenum.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/fieldnamedlikeenum.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/fieldnamedlikeenum.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 2 1 16
